    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158270/extras/bafd9629b6f85beb6cf4072b76d8d38e.avif?t=1754900316\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Football Life Simulator</strong> is a unique simulation game that lets you experience the life of a football player, both on and off the field. As you embark on a professional football career, you'll also need to manage your social life. Bar outings, car collections, friendships, and romantic relationships are just a few of the social activities awaiting you in this game. At the same time, you'll train with your teams, play matches, and climb the career ladder, developing your football skills and realizing that the more you earn, the more you need to spend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158270/extras/675c7361f486a11649ab272499bc181b.webp?t=1754900316\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Improve your football skills through realistic training mini-games and shine on the pitch with your abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158270/extras/79288c4263028558a2797e39292f1852.poster.avif?t=1754900316\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158270/extras/79288c4263028558a2797e39292f1852.webm?t=1754900316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158270/extras/79288c4263028558a2797e39292f1852.mp4?t=1754900316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste